</div><p class="dialog-lead">
Sport karate is a modern, style-independent ruleset that empowers practitioners to test their skills in a controlled, safe environment. The focus is entirely on sparring, known as kumite, which operates under a semi-contact system; thus, the objective is delivering rapid, clean strikes, with techniques executing in a strictly controlled manner. During our sport karate sessions, professional instructors will prepare you for competition, whether your aspirations lie at the local, national, or international level.
</p>
